### GET ALL ITEMS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Authorization: Basic user user
###

### GET ONE ITEM
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin

###

### DELETE ONE ITEM
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin

###

### CREATE ONE ITEM
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "name": "Mark",
  "surname": "Havrylov",
  "dateOfBirth": "2004-01-15"
}


### UPDATE ONE ITEM
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic admin admin

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "Vasyl",
  "surname": "Koval",
  "dateOfBirth": "2004-01-20"
}

### GET HELLO USER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/hello/user
Authorization: Basic admin admin


### GET HELLO ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic user user


### GET HELLO UNKNOWN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/students/hello/unknown
Authorization: Basic admin admin


